  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Green beans garlic almonds come together in a hot skillet with olive oil, filling the kitchen with that irresistible garlic aroma. Crisp tender green beans toss with golden toasted almonds, then get a bright squeeze of lemon to wake up every bite. Fast, fresh, and full of texture, green beans garlic almonds go from pan to plate in minutes, making them perfect for busy weeknights and festive meals alike. Serve them with grilled fish or roasted chicken, and watch this simple side steal the spotlight.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-green-beans-garlic-almonds\">Why You’ll Love This Green beans garlic almonds</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-green-beans-garlic-almonds\">How to Make Green Beans Garlic Almonds</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-green-beans-garlic-almonds\">Pro Tips for Making Green beans garlic almonds</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-green-beans-garlic-almonds\">How to Serve this Green beans garlic almonds</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-green-beans-garlic-almonds\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Green beans garlic almonds</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare, perfect for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nutty almonds add a delightful crunch and healthy fats.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Garlic infuses the dish with rich flavor and aroma.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bright green beans provide essential vitamins and minerals.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A versatile side that pairs well with any main dish.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-contain